the realm  do you know what the realm is  it's the thousand blades of aegon's  enemies  a story we agreed to tell each other  over  and over till we forget that it's a lie  what's up ladies and gentlemen welcome  back for another house of the dragon  update video well my friends i was  definitely wrong about when we would get  our first official teaser from hbo i was  not expecting this to drop so soon but  boy am i glad it did now for those of  you who don't know hbo released their  first official teaser for house of the  dragon only a few hours ago house of the  dragon will be set hundreds of years  before the events of game of thrones  this new series will mostly focus on  house targaryen during what is known as  the dance of dragons this was when house  targaryen fought each other over the  iron throne but in this new show we will  see so much more than just that  the dance of the dragons  a stupid name for a targaryen civil war  where my ancestors danced away my  birthright  before the war house targaryen counted  18 dragons by the end we had two and  nearly as few targaryens  we would never be as powerful or as  feared again now let's go through each  of the new images so i can give you my  thoughts on what we will see  it begins with us seeing daemon  targaryen walking through what looks  like the dungeons of either the red keep  in king's landing or maybe even  dragonstone i honestly think this is the  red keep where we have seen the dragon  skulls before in game of thrones the  next thing we see is daemon and rhaenyra  standing on the beach i think this might  be dragonstone here now for those of you  that don't know daemon is the brother of  king viserys targaryen the first of his  name and the woman he is standing next  to is rhaenyra who is the daughter of  king viceros now although daemon is  rhinera's uncle they still enter into a  romantic relationship with one another i  mean this is the way of house targaryen  after all they are not afraid of getting  some dragon on dragon action if you know  what i mean  the next thing we see is a massive  dragon skull sitting above a bunch of  candles  now this might also be inside of the red  keep in king's landing then we see the  hand of the king and i think this is  most likely serato hightower since it  looks like he is wearing green  like i said serato hightower is the hand  of the king but he is also the father of  allison hightower the future wife of  king viserys you see king viserys will  name his daughter rhaenyra as his heir  for the iron throne he does this because  he's not able to have any sons with his  first wife emma aaron after his first  wife dies he eventually marries the  young alison hightower who will give him  children in the years to follow now  what's interesting about this is allison  does give viserys a son but vasaris  doesn't name the sun as his heir he  actually leaves rhaenyra as the heir for  the iron throne but this little issue is  what eventually leads to the dance of  dragons as soon as viserys dies alison  will crown their son aegon the second of  his name before rhaenyra has a chance to  seize the iron throne for herself this  is what eventually leads to an all-out  war among house targaryen the next thing  we see in the teaser trailer is king  viserys targaryen sitting on the iron  throne i love those dragon wings on his  sword by the way  after this we see a young rhinera  targaryen standing in front of the iron  throne this is also who viserys wanted  to take the iron throne after him but as  i just said his new wife alicent will  not allow that to happen after he dies  rhaenyra will have to fight for what she  believes is rightfully hers next we see  the same image as we saw before only  from a different angle this is once  again daemon and rhaenyra only this is  the older version of rhinera i also  think this is them on dragonstone but i  can't say for sure  then we see some soldiers dressed in the  targaryen armor most likely during the  games at some tournament i think this  looks absolutely incredible i might add  i love those dragon wings on the helmets  as well then we see lord corliss  velaryon the man at the head of the  largest fleet in westeros lord corliss  velaryon will also be on the side of  rhaenyra and daemon during the dance of  dragons  in fact we will see him and daemon win  some battles during this first season  rhaenara actually marries his son lenore  although lehnor doesn't have much  interest in women if you know what i  mean  speaking of lenore this is who we see  next walking in with his father lord  corliss velaryon as well as his mother  rhaenys targaryen who is a dragon rider  herself i might add i actually can't  believe some fans are upset with hbo  hiring steve as lord corless valerion i  think he looks badass easily one of the  most interesting looking characters in  the whole show  now it looks as if they're walking into  some sort of feast maybe even a wedding  feast given they are all dressed in this  glamorous gold you can also see king  viserys targaryen and his daughter  rhaenyra sitting at the head of the  table at the end of the hall  now i believe this next character we see  here is masaria the mistress of whispers  she also has a romantic relationship  with daemon targaryen as well  she will be sort of like the varus of  house of the dragon next we see allison  hightower running with what looks like a  valyrian steel dagger the same valyrian  steel dagger arya stark used to kill the  night king i love that we will be seeing  some of the old weapons and locations  again now i'm not exactly sure what she  is running at but if you look behind her  you can also see the lore commander of  the kingsguard sir harold westerling in  the next few shots we see what looks  like a jousting tournament most likely  during the same few scenes we saw  earlier where the knights were throwing  down in the yard then we see lenore  velaryon again i think this is at his  ancestral home of driftmark given the  image on the wall i honestly have no  idea what's happening in this scene i'm  not sure who that other character is  either  let me know down below if you know  what's happening here in the scene  now i want to move on to the final few  shots this final scene is amazing and i  was actually stunned when i saw this  here we have our money shot of the new  iron throne now it still isn't exactly  like it is described in the books but it  does look much better than the last one  the new iron throne has so many more  swords which i absolutely love i  actually can't believe we are seeing new  scenes in this room again it almost  feels like this day would never come but  now it finally feels real we are about  to be back in westeros once again and i  for one cannot wait i happen to think  all of the actors look amazing i also  think all the sets and locations look  incredible everything looks and feels  exactly how it should if you ask me  i am very happy with what we have seen  so far  now we just have to wait a few more  months until we can actually start  watching this new show let me know down  below if you're excited for house of the  dragon i was actually just finishing up  on my next episode of game of thrones  season 9. i almost have that video done  but as soon as i saw this i had to set  the video aside so i can give some of my  thoughts about the new teaser trailer as  always let me know what you think about  everything down below also let me know  if there is anything i missed i will  definitely be watching this video again  and again for now i want to thank all of  you for stopping by and checking out my  video i hope all of you have a great day  i will see you again very soon  [Music]  [Music]  you

